// <functional> - [function.objects]: the comparisons, the arithmetic, the logical and bitwise function
// objects; the C++98 adaptors (unary_function, the negators, bind1st, ptr_fun, mem_fun); reference_wrapper
// and mem_fn; std::function, which erases what it holds behind one virtual call; bind and its
// placeholders; and the hashes of the scalar types and pointers, FNV-1a over the bytes as cl's are.
